The '''Baker Detective Agency''' (Japanese: '''ベイカー{{tt|探偵事務所|たんていじむしょ}}''' ''Baker Detective Agency'') is a detective agency based in [[Ryme City]] in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. Their offices are located on the second floor of a building south of [[Tahnti Park]], above the [[Hi-Hat Café]]. It is first visited at the end of Chapter 1.

The director of the agency is [[Mike Baker]], who is assisted by [[Amanda Blackstone]].

